      "finding": "Guide explicitly calls this a set and names all 12 equipment rewards: three initial rewards plus nine Post Summoning choices. This supports an umbrella collection independently of common quest giver or shared faction. Classic and normal armors, single/dual weapons, and the two pets retain distinct canonical item identities. Hardcore Contract, classes, and other consumed/owned prerequisites are excluded.",
      "remainingScopeIssue": "No unsupported extra parent members found. If product policy requires separate set cards for Classic versus normal acquisition variants, an umbrella alone does not satisfy that separate representation requirement; the Guide does not explicitly assign all common accessories between those hypothetical sub-sets."
