        }
      ],
      "finding": "The Guide names the 25 initial rewards explicitly, so they are documented outputs rather than inferred from faction/name matching. But the chapter also explicitly enumerates 14 Roles Unreversed choices and 17 Orb bonus rewards (3 Hex, 6 Blood, 4 Fiend, 4 Shadow), and it contains distinct Void/Legacy/Metamorphosis/Archfiend identities. Unlike Paladin and Lich King, the read range does not explicitly call every chapter output one equipment set; a broad Guide chapter and progression chain alone do not establish a single completed variant set.",
      "remainingScopeIssue": "Do not mark parent25 DONE or present it as complete. Keep chapter umbrella scope explicitly partial, retain separate canonical variants, and require direct family/collection evidence before assigning the independently named bonus families to sub-sets. Owned Juggernaut/Twisted gear, Hollowborn Oblivion Blade, and Nulgath House Guest are prerequisites, not members merely because they unlock these quests. Archfiend Runes category still requires equipment eligibility review."
    },
